@theviewny is the New York City’s only revolving rooftop restaurant and lounge, offering 360-degree views of the city skyline! Is perfect for a drink after a show or to get a nice dessert! My favorite dessert is the chocolate cake with warm caramel on the top! This is so beautiful, the service is amazing and the views are spectacular! 

📍 The View is located inside the New York Marriott Marquis on the 48th floor

